[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "特にケガもなく、眠っているだけのようです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "She doesn't appear injured. It seems she's merely sleeping."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "千歳",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Chitose"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "振り返った時には、このような状態だったのか……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So she was already in this state when you turned around..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい。倒れる直前まで、普通に話してたっす",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. She was talking normally right up until she collapsed."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "実は、すごい寝不足だったのを隠してたとか？\n素敵な女性には秘密が多いっていうからさ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Maybe she was hiding how sleep-deprived she was? They say beautiful women often have secrets."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "疲れが溜まっていたなら、突然ふらっと来ても\n不思議ではありませんな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If she was exhausted, it wouldn't be strange for her to suddenly faint."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "で、でも。そんな様子はなかったんだけど",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "B-but she didn't seem tired at all."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうですね。何か不自然な力が……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Indeed. Something unnatural seems to be at work..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "千歳",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Chitose"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナ！\u3000もうもう、心配したんだよー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna! Geez, you had me so worried!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナ様。どこか気分の悪いところはありませんか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna, are you feeling unwell anywhere?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "千歳",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Chitose"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "良い城だ……我をもてなすのにふさわしいではないか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A fine castle... Worthy of hosting me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "む？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hm?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "我は……私は満足していない……\nまだ私の年は終わっていません！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I am... I am not satisfied... My year is not yet over!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "は！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この城を蛇神信仰の本拠地――蛇神城とします！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I shall make this castle the headquarters of the Serpent God faith—the Serpent God Castle!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ちょ、ちょっとレスナ！\u3000\nいきなりどうしちゃったのさ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "W-wait, Resna! What's gotten into you all of a sudden?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これは錬金術の素材に使えそうですね……えい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This could work as alchemy material... Hup."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "い、いや、待たれよ！\n城内のものを勝手に使われては！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "N-no, wait! You can't just take things from the castle!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はっ。その前に、ここで調合できるようにするべき！\nまずは錬金釜を用意せねば！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah. First, I should set up for synthesis here! I need to get a cauldron!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "待ったぁ！\u3000どこから持って来ようとしてるわけ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hold it! Where are you planning to get that from?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そ、そうだよ！\nさすがにここに錬金釜なんか据え付けるのは……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "R-right! You can't just set up a cauldron in here...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "止めるんですか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're going to stop me?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この城の主は余だ。止めるとするなら、どうする？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I am the lord of this castle. If you intend to stop her, what will you do?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私を止めようとするなら、勝負です！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If you try to stop me, I challenge you!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ははっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hahaha!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ま、待ってください！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "W-wait, please!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "千歳",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Chitose"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "今のレスナ様には、何か良くないものが憑いている\nみたいです！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Something malevolent seems to have possessed Resna!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "千歳",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Chitose"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ほう？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええええっ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Whaaaat?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "みんな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Everyone"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふふ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehehehe..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]